**Nisarg Srishti Welfare Foundation (NSWF)** is an Indian non-profit environmental non-governmental organization headquartered in Pune, Maharashtra. Incorporated on 11 January 2023 as a non-profit entity under the Ministry of Corporate Affairs, the organization focuses on urban noise pollution mitigation, acoustic mapping, water conservation, e-waste awareness, and community-based sustainability education.

#### **1. Background**

Nisarg Srishti Welfare Foundation was formally registered on 11 January 2023 with the Registrar of Companies (RoC) in Pune under Corporate Identification Number (CIN) `U85300PN2023NPL217884`. The organization was founded by Garima Gaurav Kavathekar, who serves as its Managing Director, alongside Director Deepali Kavathekar and Additional Director Nagesh Alkunthe. Operating from Manjari BK in Pune, the foundation holds an ISO 14001:2015 certification for environmental management practices.

